Package: hyperloom
Type: Package
Title: CTTIR Hyperspectral Imaging Suite
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@charite.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Installs and attaches the CTTIR hyperspectral imaging suite:
    'hyperspectR' for processing and analysis, 'hyperspectaculR' for
    visualization, 'cuvis.r' for Cubert CUVIS recordings, and 'tivis.r' for
    TIVITA recordings. Provides a suite membership inventory and installed
    version report. Instrument software, calibration, and analysis methods
    remain the responsibility of the individual packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/hyperloom
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/hyperloom/issues
